<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Shahjahanpur | Insured Two-Wheeler Shipping UP
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my bike via Indian Railways from Shahjahanpur, and how does it compare to road transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Indian Railways offers a bike parcel service from Shahjahanpur, but it involves longer transit times, limited loading flexibility, and requires you to handle packaging yourself. Road transport with Shree Ashirwad provides door‑to‑door pickup, hydraulic ramp loading, real‑time GPS tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee, making it faster, safer, and more convenient for most customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the process for booking a bike parcel service on a train (IRCTC) from Shahjahanpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To book via IRCTC, log into the IRCTC portal, select ‘Bike Parcel’ under the cargo services, enter origin (Shahjahanpur) and destination, upload bike details, and pay the freight charge. You will receive a booking reference, after which you must drop the bike at the designated railway parcel office, where it will be loaded onto a dedicated cargo coach. Documentation and insurance are optional and handled separately.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a scooter transport service near me in Shahjahanpur that offers door‑to‑door pickup?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides a dedicated scooter and moped transport service across Shahjahanpur with doorstep pickup. Our team schedules a convenient time, arrives with a GPS‑tracked hydraulic ramp trailer, secures the scooter using nylon belt anchorage, and delivers it scratch‑free to the destination. The service is fully insured and includes a fixed, transparent price quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad handle bike transport on buses or multi‑modal routes?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">When a multi‑modal route is required, we coordinate with reputable bus operators and freight carriers to ensure the bike is loaded onto a dedicated compartment using our 7‑layer packaging and wheel‑chock system. Each transfer point is documented, and real‑time tracking continues throughout the journey. Our insurance covers any transit segment, and the bike is inspected at every handover to maintain the zero‑scratch promise.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transport from Anand to Shahjahanpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a bike shipment from Anand to Shahjahanpur you need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID proof, a signed consignment note, and a copy of the insurance policy (if you choose additional coverage). Shree Ashirwad also prepares an IBA‑approved claim bill, which can be submitted for corporate or government reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike size or type for the hydraulic ramp trailers used in Shahjahanpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers can accommodate motorcycles, scooters, and mopeds up to 2,200 kg GVW and a length of 2.5 meters. Extremely oversized or custom‑built bikes may require a specialized container, which we can arrange on request. All standard two‑wheelers fit comfortably, and the ramp’s adjustable angle ensures safe loading without any damage.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
